d 'qdid': module for quantile treatment effects in difference-in-differences
d
d Implements Callaway & Li (2019, Quantitative Economics 10(4): 1579-1618):
d quantile treatment effects on the treated (QTT) in panel DiD via copula
d stability. Bootstrap pointwise intervals and a uniform confidence band across
d quantiles (cband); conditional QTT via propensity-score covariates(); and
d staggered adoption via gvar() (not-yet-treated controls).
d
d Author: Haoyu Niu
d Distribution-Date: 20261007
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
f qdid.ado
f qdid.sthlp
f qdid.mata
f qdid_zh.sthlp
